<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cavalier picks better yr for carpet, wool.</title>
<headline>Cavalier picks better yr for carpet, wool.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cavalier Corp Ltd said on Thursday it was &quot;cautiously optimistic&quot; that 1996/97 would prove to be a better year for its carpet business.</p>
<p>It said there were already signs of a more buoyant market in Australia, and it was forecasting some modest recovery in New Zealand. It also predicted 1996/97 would prove to be a better operating environment for wool.</p>
</text>
